  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Peperoni ripieni are baked peppers filled with a simple rice and herb mixture. The rice is par-cooked before filling: it finishes cooking inside the pepper, absorbing the pepper's juices as the dish bakes. Use large, firm peppers with flat bases so they stand upright in the baking dish."
          }
        ]
      },
